OL,3,ABurnham received #345,000 of donations
OL,4,Aahead of becoming PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has registered accepting
OL,7,F#345,000 of donations over the past
OL,8,Fyear including #164,347 from
OL,9,Fbusinessman Lord Sainsbury.
OL,11,FThe donations, listed in the most
OL,12,Frecent version of the MPs' register of
OL,13,Finterests,, external are the prime
OL,14,Fminister's first declarations since he
OL,15,Fwas elected to Parliament in June.
OL,17,FSeparately, Burnham has also listed
OL,18,Fhospitality and gifts he received in
OL,19,Fthe year before he returned to
OL,20,FParliament, including trips to
OL,21,FGlastonbury, Lancashire Cricket Club
OL,22,Fand the Aintree Racecourse.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
