OL,3,ABurnham received #345,000 of donations
OL,4,Aahead of becoming PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Labour Party spokesperson said: "It's
OL,7,Fright that political campaigns are
OL,8,Ffunded by the generous support of party
OL,9,Fdonors, rather than via the public
OL,10,Fpurse.
